                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "I guard the glacier gate below town so nobody meets the Ice leader half-thawed. I saw you crest the last drift - on a glacier the eye carries forever. Warm your team on mine before the real cold."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The two on the road behind me were the chill. I am the freeze. Get past me and the leader is survivable."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "There is a name the old town keeps under ice, unspoken, and it fits your face too well. I will not thaw it. Settle what you are on the field instead."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Sten Glacierguard",
                    Label: "default"
                }
